his is my rifle.  there are many like it, but this one is mine.  My rifle is my best friend.  It is my life.  I must master it as I must master my life.\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>I feel an army in my fist.\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>Caliber doesn't count when you're on the receiving side of the barrel.\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>One will hit.  It's a matter of statistics.\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>Survival is my game.\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>Like a fish to water.\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>A needle, a thread and a dream.\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>Two volts enter, one volt leaves.  Resistance is futile.\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>A good trap doesn't discriminate between beavers and zombeavers.\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>When the sword is once drawn, the passions of men observe no bounds of moderation.\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>And never come back.\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>Survive for a day and find a safe place to sleep\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>Run a marathon…plus a little bit more.\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>Walk 500 miles, then walk 500 more.\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\n<color_c_red>\nInternal error: achievement lacks watcher.</color>\nNote that only achievements that existed when you started this game and still exist now will appear h